# One system per line, started in this order, each in its own tmux pane.
# Lines beginning with # are ignored, as are blank ones.
#
# Order matters at the start and not much after it. The CA must be able to
# answer before anything asks it for a certificate, and the maitreD must be
# there to attest the processes that ask — so those two come first, and the
# authorizer next if the cloud enforces authorization. Everything below that
# retries until what it needs appears.
#
# Copy this to systems.txt and edit. That file is deliberately not tracked:
# what a site runs is the site's business, and a bench running three systems
# should not have to argue with a cottage running fourteen.

ca
maitreD
authorizer
esr
orchestrator
